# contests.dat - contest definitions for ShackLog (#4)
#
# What a contest IS: its exchange, and whether it is a county-based state
# party. Enough to lay out an entry form, drive a worked/needed table, and
# sanity-check a Cabrillo export. NOT a scoring model - multipliers and
# points rules are deliberately out of scope, see src/ContestDef.h.
#
# Format, one record per line, pipe-separated:
#   ID|Name|SentFields|ReceivedFields|CountyState|OutOfStateWorksOutOfState
#
# ID              Cabrillo CONTEST: value, uppercase; matches qsos.contest_id
# SentFields      comma-separated, IN SENDING ORDER - this sets tab order
# ReceivedFields  same, for what the other station sends
# CountyState     two-letter state whose counties are the multiplier; empty
#                 for contests that are not county-based
# OutOfState...   1 when out-of-state stations also work each other, else 0
#
# Field names: RST, SERIAL, COUNTY, STATE, SECTION, GRID, NAME, POWER, AGE,
#              TEXT
#
# ONLY contests whose exchange has been confirmed against the sponsor's own
# rules belong here. The long tail is handled generically: an unknown
# contest_id simply has no definition, and ShackLog falls back to its
# everyday layout. A definition that is present but WRONG is worse than one
# that is absent, because the entry form and the Cabrillo check would both
# act on it.
#
# STATUS: the entries below are a STARTING SET whose exchange shape is the
# common county-party form (RST + county, some with a serial). They have NOT
# been checked line-by-line against each sponsor's current rules, and rules
# do change between years. Confirm before relying on one for a submitted log,
# and treat a mismatch as a bug in this file rather than in the code.
#
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
#
MDC-QSO-PARTY|Maryland-DC QSO Party|RST,COUNTY|RST,COUNTY|MD|0
FLQP|Florida QSO Party|RST,COUNTY|RST,COUNTY|FL|0
CQP|California QSO Party|RST,SERIAL,COUNTY|RST,SERIAL,COUNTY|CA|0
PAQP|Pennsylvania QSO Party|RST,SERIAL,COUNTY|RST,SERIAL,COUNTY|PA|0
OHQP|Ohio QSO Party|RST,COUNTY|RST,COUNTY|OH|0
TXQP|Texas QSO Party|RST,COUNTY|RST,COUNTY|TX|0
